    "_sText": "<b>You don't need to like or agree with this mod, but if that's the case, please keep your thoughts to yourself<\/b>. We are all aware of Hoyo's preferred twin for marketing, this is in-game stuff. All choices are canon, they wouldn't be choices otherwise.<br><br>For once in my life I did some work in advance and what does my stupid brain decide? LET'S DO EVEN MORE INSTEAD OF PLAYING THE DAMN QUEST.<br><br>So, appart from the usual Aether removal I also added, TWO extra lumine versions: Skin and skin recolor with her usual blue, all of them accompanied by their own map banner art. I guess it's a good trade for the lack of an actual travelerless version for the main quest art.<br><br><del>Maybe if you beg I could also do an Aether skin ver, spoil you lot a bit more\/j<\/del>",
